{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a936d84cdb632f82","name":"Brute Squad Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-a936d84cdb632f82","title":"Brute Squad Talent Tree","revision":16400,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:50Z","sha256":"d07894049133297449201cbe9ec3d5454662fc3a09198fcdea0c36c7ea16fb9d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16400","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Brute%20Squad%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a936d84cdb632f82","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your brutal fighting techniques give you an upper hand when operating in small groups.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Gang Leader"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},", you gain a +1 bonus on the check for every ally within 6 squares of you and in the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," (maximum +5 bonus).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Melee Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target that has one or more of your allies adjacent to it, compare the result to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," as well as its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the attack hits both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},", the attack deals +1 die of damage and the target is knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Melee Brute"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target that has one or more of your allies adjacent to it, compare the result to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," as well as its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the attack hits both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},", the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by 2 squares and it takes a -2 penalty to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Melee Opportunist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when an ally makes a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target adjacent to you, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against that target as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", with a +2 bonus on the attack roll.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Squad Brutality"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target that has one or more of your allies adjacent to it, you may reroll your damage roll, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Squad Superiority"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you and at least two allies are adjacent to the same target, that target is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against you.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
